      style: "$title"

  - elementId: page-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 78, 880, 20]
    content:
      text: "练习示例 · 诊断推理过程、失误点定位与防错检查规则（与第 07 页演练对齐）"
      style: "$subtitle"

  - elementId: feedback-tag
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 106, 250, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: feedback-tag-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 106, 250, 24]
    content:
      text: "【参考解答与推理路径 · 诊断复盘】"
      style: "$badge"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      letterSpacing: 0.5

  - elementId: left-deduction-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 138, 420, 310]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$lightBlue" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: left-deduction-header
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 150, 388, 22]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>标准三步推导逻辑链 (Deduction Chain)</strong></p>"
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$primaryDeep"

  - elementId: step-deduct-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 178, 388, 70]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong>第一步：排除终端个体故障（定界往上移）</strong><br/>
        手机、电视、笔记本三台设备使用不同操作系统（iOS/Android/Windows），同时报连接超时，证伪了单机无线网卡驱动或私密 MAC 冲突假说，故障点必定在网络公共干道上。</p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.8
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: step-deduct-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 256, 388, 70]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong>第二步：排除运营商光纤与欠费（定界往下移）</strong><br/>
        光猫 PON 绿灯常亮、LOS 完全熄灭，证实物理光路光衰优良，与机房 OLT 注册完好；且昨日刚缴纳宽带费，排除了欠费停机。<strong>此时绝不能拨打报修电话，否则徒增等待。</strong></p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.8
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: step-deduct-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 334, 388, 104]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong>第三步：锁定光猫至路由器连接网线（精准击中）</strong><br/>
        路由器 Internet/WAN 指示灯呈橙色慢闪，结合上午电视柜挪动历史，直接推导出：<strong>光猫 LAN 口连入路由器 WAN 口的六类网线在清扫中被外力扯松或卡扣脱钩</strong>，导致物理层协商降级或断开，路由器无法通过 DHCP 从光猫获取有效 IP。</p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.8
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: right-solution-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 138, 420, 310]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$bgLight" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: right-solution-header
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 150, 388, 22]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>正确处置三部曲与防错复盘 (Action & Verification)</strong></p>"
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$primaryDeep"

  - elementId: right-solution-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 178, 388, 260]
    content:
      autofit: fit_text
      text: |
        <p><strong>1. 现场第一处置动作：</strong><br/>
        走向弱电箱，找到连接光猫与路由器的主要网线。将两端水晶头分别用力按入光猫 LAN1 口与路由器 WAN 口（通常为蓝色），<strong>直至听见清脆的塑料弹片“咔哒”机械锁定声</strong>。</p>
        <p><strong>2. 观察指示灯转正反馈：</strong><br/>
        按紧网线后静待 10~15 秒，观察路由器 Internet/WAN 指示灯由橙色慢闪转为<strong>常亮或快速绿色频闪</strong>。电视与手机网页应在 30 秒内自愈恢复访问。</p>
        <p><strong>3. 若指示灯仍未变绿（二次备用方案）：</strong><br/>
        若指示灯依旧为橙色，说明水晶头弹片已折断或金属触点氧化。执行「序贯断电冷启动」：先拔光猫和路由器电源，静置 30 秒后依次重新通电；若仍不通，换一条备用千兆网线测试。</p>
        <p><strong>防错总结：</strong>切忌一看到断网就掏牙签捅 Reset！全屋断网有超过 70% 属于此类机械外力导致的虚接，手摇按紧即可恢复。</p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.6
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: bottom-learning-anchor
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 462, 880, 30]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>核心原则：</strong>看灯知因，按线解难。排障永远从物理最薄弱点（插头卡扣、电线弯折）查起，以零破坏性的机械确认开始，以序贯冷启动结束。</p>"
      fontSize: 10.5
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"

  - elementId: bottom-source-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 508, 800, 18]
    content:
      text: "说明：本页为第 07 页虚拟演练之官方解析标准，用于强化排障推理因果严密性"
      style: "$caption"

  - elementId: bottom-page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [870, 508, 50, 18]
    content:
      text: "08"
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, top]
